---
---
<figure class="karatsuba-hero" aria-labelledby="karatsuba-hero-caption">
  <div class="hero-top">
    <div>
      <p class="hero-eyebrow">Une idée d’algorithmique · 1962</p>
      <p class="hero-statement">Multiplier autrement.</p>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Karatsuba remplace quatre produits de blocs par trois — puis répète cette économie à chaque niveau.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-count" aria-label="Quatre produits deviennent trois">
      <span>4</span><i>→</i><strong>3</strong>
      <small>produits récursifs</small>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-workflow">
    <section class="hero-stage hero-inputs" aria-label="Découpage des opérandes">
      <div class="stage-heading"><span>01</span> DÉCOUPER</div>
      <div class="operand">
        <span class="operand-label">x</span>
        <strong><span class="high">12</span><span class="low">34</span></strong>
        <small>1 234 = 12 × 100 + 34</small>
      </div>
      <div class="operand">
        <span class="operand-label">y</span>
        <strong><span class="high">56</span><span class="low">78</span></strong>
        <small>5 678 = 56 × 100 + 78</small>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="hero-connector" aria-hidden="true">→</div>

    <section class="hero-stage hero-products" aria-label="Trois produits nécessaires">
      <div class="stage-heading"><span>02</span> CALCULER TROIS PRODUITS</div>
      <div class="product-row">
        <span class="product-symbol common">p</span>
        <span class="product-expression"><strong>12 × 56</strong><small>haut × haut</small></span>
        <b class="product-value">672</b>
      </div>
      <div class="product-row">
        <span class="product-symbol common">q</span>
        <span class="product-expression"><strong>34 × 78</strong><small>bas × bas</small></span>
        <b class="product-value">2 652</b>
      </div>
      <div class="product-row auxiliary-row">
        <span class="product-symbol auxiliary">r</span>
        <span class="product-expression"><strong>(12 + 34)(56 + 78)</strong><small>produit des sommes</small></span>
        <b class="product-value">6 164</b>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-reconstruction">
    <div class="reconstruction-copy">
      <span class="stage-heading"><span>03</span> RECONSTRUIRE</span>
      <strong class="cross-equation">r − p − q = <em>2 840</em></strong>
      <small>Le terme croisé ad + bc, sans calculer ad et bc séparément.</small>
    </div>
    <div class="reconstruction-result">
      <span>PRODUIT EXACT</span>
      <strong>7 006 652</strong>
      <small>672 × 10 000 + 2 840 × 100 + 2 652</small>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="karatsuba-hero-caption">Un même calcul, deux chemins : le développement direct calcule les quatre produits partiels ; Karatsuba obtient le terme croisé par différence à partir d’un troisième produit auxiliaire.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .karatsuba-hero { --kh-ink:#f5f1e7; --kh-muted:#c3c9bd; --kh-green:#284b3c; --kh-green-2:#37634e; --kh-line:rgba(245,241,231,.2); margin:1.4rem 0 2.6rem; padding:clamp(1.1rem,3.2vw,2rem); border-radius:1rem; overflow:hidden; color:var(--kh-ink); background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 0%,#426b50 0,transparent 42%),linear-gradient(135deg,#1e392f,#294c3d 70%,#203b31); box-shadow:0 18px 42px rgba(34,48,37,.12); }
  .karatsuba-hero * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  .hero-top { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap:1.5rem; align-items:end; padding-bottom:1.5rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--kh-line); }
  .hero-eyebrow,.stage-heading,.reconstruction-result>span { margin:0; color:#d9b77e; font:600 .64rem/1.4 "DM Mono",monospace; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .hero-statement { margin:.45rem 0 .35rem; color:var(--kh-ink); font:500 clamp(2rem,5vw,3.6rem)/.98 "Newsreader",Georgia,serif; letter-spacing:-.045em; }
  .hero-subtitle { max-width:34rem; margin:0; color:#d7ded4; font: .91rem/1.55 "DM Sans",sans-serif; }
  .hero-count { display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto auto auto; align-items:center; column-gap:.35rem; text-align:center; white-space:nowrap; }
  .hero-count span,.hero-count strong { font:500 clamp(2.8rem,6vw,4.6rem)/.85 "Newsreader",Georgia,serif; }
  .hero-count span { color:#d5ddd1; }
  .hero-count i { color:#d9b77e; font:400 2rem "DM Sans",sans-serif; }
  .hero-count strong { color:#e6bd79; }
  .hero-count small { grid-column:1/-1; margin-top:.5rem; color:#d7ded4; font: .62rem "DM Mono",monospace; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .hero-workflow { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.9fr) 24px minmax(0,1.1fr); gap:.85rem; align-items:center; padding:1.5rem 0; }
  .hero-stage { min-width:0; }
  .stage-heading { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.55rem; margin-bottom:.85rem; color:#d5ddd1; }
  .stage-heading span { display:grid; place-items:center; width:1.35rem; height:1.35rem; border:1px solid rgba(217,183,126,.7); border-radius:50%; color:#e6bd79; font-size:.58rem; }
  .operand { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1rem 1fr; gap:.15rem .55rem; align-items:center; margin:.45rem 0; padding:.55rem .65rem; border:1px solid var(--kh-line); border-radius:.55rem; background:rgba(255,255,255,.055); }
  .operand-label { grid-row:1/3; color:#d9b77e; font:italic 1rem "Newsreader",serif; }
  .operand strong { display:flex; gap:.25rem; font:600 1.25rem/1.1 "DM Mono",monospace; }
  .operand strong span { display:inline-grid; place-items:center; min-width:2.25rem; padding:.2rem .35rem; border-radius:.25rem; }
  .operand .high { color:#e0edf4; background:#476a7a; }
  .operand .low { color:#e7f0dc; background:#62794d; }
  .operand small { grid-column:2; color:#c3c9bd; font: .62rem/1.35 "DM Mono",monospace; }
  .hero-connector { color:#d9b77e; text-align:center; font:1.6rem "DM Sans",sans-serif; }
  .product-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.7rem minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap:.55rem; align-items:center; margin:.45rem 0; padding:.58rem .65rem; border:1px solid var(--kh-line); border-radius:.5rem; background:rgba(255,255,255,.055); }
  .product-symbol { display:grid; place-items:center; width:1.65rem; height:1.65rem; border-radius:.35rem; font:600 .85rem "DM Mono",monospace; }
  .product-symbol.common { color:#d6ebe3; background:#3d7464; }
  .product-symbol.auxiliary { color:#f0e4fa; background:#76628e; }
  .product-expression { display:grid; gap:.1rem; min-width:0; }
  .product-expression strong { overflow-wrap:anywhere; color:#f5f1e7; font:600 clamp(.7rem,1.8vw,.86rem)/1.3 "DM Mono",monospace; }
  .product-expression small { color:#c3c9bd; font: .61rem/1.3 "DM Sans",sans-serif; }
  .product-value { color:#e7d7b5; font:600 .78rem "DM Mono",monospace; white-space:nowrap; }
  .auxiliary-row { border-color:rgba(186,160,215,.55); background:rgba(118,98,142,.17); }
  .hero-reconstruction { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto; gap:1rem; align-items:center; padding:1rem; border:1px solid rgba(217,183,126,.42); border-radius:.65rem; background:rgba(10,25,19,.25); }
  .reconstruction-copy .stage-heading { margin-bottom:.55rem; }
  .cross-equation { display:block; color:#f5f1e7; font:600 clamp(.95rem,2.5vw,1.3rem)/1.35 "DM Mono",monospace; }
  .cross-equation em { color:#f0c47e; font-style:normal; }
  .reconstruction-copy>small { display:block; max-width:25rem; margin-top:.3rem; color:#c3c9bd; font:.68rem/1.4 "DM Sans",sans-serif; }
  .reconstruction-result { display:grid; gap:.3rem; text-align:right; }
  .reconstruction-result>span { color:#d9b77e; font-size:.56rem; }
  .reconstruction-result strong { color:#f2d7a6; font:600 clamp(1.15rem,3vw,1.7rem)/1 "DM Mono",monospace; white-space:nowrap; }
  .reconstruction-result small { color:#c3c9bd; font:.58rem/1.4 "DM Mono",monospace; }
  .karatsuba-hero figcaption { margin-top:1rem; color:#c3c9bd; font:.7rem/1.55 "DM Sans",sans-serif; }
  @media(max-width:620px) { .hero-top { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:1rem; } .hero-count { justify-self:start; } .hero-workflow { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:.55rem; padding:1.15rem 0; } .hero-connector { transform:rotate(90deg); line-height:1; } .hero-reconstruction { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .reconstruction-result { text-align:left; padding-top:.8rem; border-top:1px solid var(--kh-line); } }
</style>
